OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in Liverpool Street Tube
OL,4,Astation attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being attacked at
OL,7,FLiverpool Street Tube station,
OL,8,Faccording to British Transport Police.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Feastbound Central line platform at
OL,12,F10:51 BST on 30 August. A 32-year-old
OL,13,Fman was taken to hospital in a critical
OL,14,Fcondition, where he later died on 1
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FBefore the man's death, Jeremiah
OL,18,FMaximo, 38, of Drydock Square, Barking,
OL,19,Fwas charged with grievous bodily harm.
OL,20,FBTP said it would now apply to amend
OL,21,Fthe charge, which will take place at a
OL,22,Flater date at court.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
